@host = http://localhost:3000

### Verificar saúde
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Buscar métricas
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### Buscar faturas
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

### Buscar fatura por identificador
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/1

### Buscar fatura por identificador indisponível (404)
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/999999

### Buscar fatura por identificador inválido (400)
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/abc


### Criar fatura
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json 

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 123243,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### Alterar fatura
PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/181
Content-Type: application/json 

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 123243,
    "status": "paid",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### Deletar fatura
DELETE {{host}}/api/invoices/181